  "fields": {
    "responsibility": "Deliver the complete managed C-target frozen-root population: one VM epoch, six canonical root kinds, admitted writers/borrows, actual generated entry roots and physical-exit custody. Fourteen handwritten paths plus sixteen exact generated C products.",
    "retired": "Per-invocation source lifetime and independent RC epochs; shared mutable primitive heap pointers in image cells; raw Scheme inputs crossing marker allocation without roots; local DONE granting retirement. CPU raw writable-cell fixups are explicitly unimplemented, not a legacy alias.",
    "validation": "Same persistent Modern C workspace and existing Bazel-derived configure/Make profile: full two-pass bootstrap257.154s and stock core66.653s; official GSI408/40822.300s; all remaining original Make prerequisites61.497s; all290 layout assertions, multi-shot frames, nonzero RC, six-kind PBT252 actions, marker PBT296 actions, three partial-bank boundaries, three VM lifecycle cycles, old module refusal/current load. SysML/ASCENT15 source and20 native cases;24 shared submission-framework tests. Original limits and populations unchanged.",
    "benefits": "The actual primitive relocation witness changes bitmap3 to7, and the old cleanup predicate admits a still-joined domain while production refuses. Root storage survives complete restoration, not only local scan completion. Preserve Gambit precise frame knowledge, tail dispatch and multi-shot continuation; no one-shot rule or runtime speedup inferred.",
    "costs": "Native VM-local primitive storage adds162504 bytes/VM on this profile; round descriptor14544 bytes/VM plus two pointers/domain; four additional GC collectives; one RC allocation per raw Scheme argument and a physical-entry catcher; primitive override lookup/publication work. RSS, pause and throughput remain unmeasured.",
    "process": "First complete frozen-root integration result:1/4 qualified,3 complete integration results remain. The13-item catalogue and pending source queue are ownership indexes. Independent SMP families remain1/12 bootstrap-only with11 open and retained failures; no repair-line progress transferred.",
    "checklist": "dev/refactoring/modern-c/frozen-root-union.org#FROZEN-ROOT-UNION",
    "models": "Native SysML drives source/native obligations and ASCENT closure. Existing Quint owns temporal freeze/borrow/collective histories; existing Lean owns conditional canonical-slot/coverage/reload laws. Actual C intervals and caller premises are reviewed explicitly; no duplicated model or claimed C weak-memory theorem.",
    "open": "Next: physical census/packing and independent worker/restoration ownership; then affine-resource/unknown-owner retirement and request execution. Full compiled408-unit, stress, Gerbil product and performance families remain open. Full CPU trampoline, unrestricted private/asynchronous native aliases and untested platform profiles are not admitted."
